# The two counter-propagating waves see the same loop, so the result does not depend on wavelength: reflection 4 kappa (1 - kappa) = 0.64.

title Sagnac loop mirror, coupling 20%
medium lambda0=1.55 neff=2.4 ng=4.2 loss_db_cm=0
sweep 1.5 1.6 201

comp c coupler kappa=0.2
comp w waveguide length=300
link c.3 w.1
link w.2 c.4
port in c.1
port out c.2

expect lossless
expect level in 1.55 -1.93820026 1e-6
expect level out 1.55 -4.43697499 1e-6
